    "src/core/architecture-reference.js || src/pages/architecture-framework.data.js": "SINGLE-SOURCED 2026-11-07 (#1246): CURRENT_ROUTE_CONTRACTS now lives once in src/core/architecture-route-contracts.js and both surfaces import it, taking this pair 1667 -> 389 windows. It was the repo's largest banked duplication and it had ALREADY DRIFTED - of 268 routes, 195 contracts matched and 73 did not, so the human page described superseded behaviour and no gate noticed (validate-arch-surfaces compares the ROUTE SET, not the contracts). What remains here is CURRENT_SLICE and DATABASE_SCHEMA, which differ on purpose (the page paraphrases). Do NOT re-duplicate the route array.",
    "nest/src/modules/directives/implementations/macd-divergence.directive.ts || nest/src/modules/directives/implementations/obv-divergence.directive.ts": "DONE 2026-09-21 - was 34 windows of DUPLICATED SCORING ALGORITHM, now 4. The five swing/divergence helpers moved to nest/src/modules/directives/utils/divergence.ts and all three directives import them. What REMAINS here is imports and the IDirective class preamble - structure, not logic. Proven behaviour-preserving: 108 golden cases (12 seeds x 3 bar-counts x 3 directives, 29 of them exercising the strength formula) produced a BYTE-IDENTICAL result before and after (sha256 333719E6...). The three strength CALIBRATIONS deliberately stay per-directive and now sit side by side in one place; see StrengthModel in utils/divergence.ts for why they differ.",
    "src/pages/ProtocolTrailPage.jsx || src/pages/SinglesMonitorPage.jsx": "NOT deliberate - extraction candidate, measured 2026-09-19. Both consume the same breakdown payload and repeat its mapping (breakouts / subScores / subMaxTotals) across six separate blocks - STILL NOT DONE. PARTIALLY PAID 2026-10-06: the pair had grown 27 -> 39 because two agents independently fixed the same owner request ('the page is reachable only by URL - add a symbol search') by pasting a byte-identical 12-line SymbolAutocomplete->?symbol= wrapper into each page. That block was EXTRACTED to src/components/SymbolPickerField.jsx, taking the pair 39 -> 29 (10 windows removed). The 2 windows banked since are the shared import line and the single <SymbolPickerField value={symbol} /> usage - the CONSEQUENCE of extracting, not new duplication. A shared component cannot be shared without being imported.",
    "nest/src/modules/system/architecture-manifest.controller.ts || src/core/architecture-reference.js": "NOT deliberate - the controller EMBEDS the pipeline-step descriptions that architecture-reference.js also declares, so the same prose exists in the backend and the frontend. Single-source candidate. Not done.",
